Guardian persona artwork
Copyright (c) 2026 Felipe Cavalcanti. All rights reserved.

This notice repeats firmware/art/LICENSE beside the website copies of the
artwork, with paths given from the repository root and the website use
recorded below. Where the two differ, firmware/art/LICENSE governs, and the
website record grants nothing beyond it.

What this covers
  The artwork of the Guardian persona, wherever a copy sits in this
  repository: the portraits and masters, the sheets and previews, the 3D
  source file, the frame packs and the packed portraits generated from them
  (image, model and packed-art files under firmware/art/, and any generated
  copy of them elsewhere in the tree, including the portraits in
  website/public/images/ and the social card the website draws from them).

Provenance
  The accepted portraits are an AI-rendered illustration pack supplied by the
  repository owner and post-processed by the scripts in firmware/art/; the
  earlier procedural version was generated with Blender (see
  docs/G15-persona.md). The persona is inspired by Guy Fawkes mask
  iconography. No claim is made here over any third-party design or mark, and
  nothing in this file grants a right in one.

What this does not cover
  The scripts in firmware/art/ (the .py files that build, check and pack the
  art) and the website's source code are under the repository's MIT license
  (LICENSE at the repository root).

Use specified by the copyright holder for this website
  The copyright holder has specified that the artwork is shown on the M5
  Guardian website built from website/: on its pages, on the simulated
  StickS3 screen, and in the website's social-sharing card. That is the
  copyright holder's own use; it grants nobody else any right, and it does
  not extend to copies of the website, its deployment by anyone else, or the
  artwork outside it.

What you may do
  View the artwork, and use it unmodified to build this firmware for your own
  personal, non-commercial use on your own device.

What you may not do without written permission from the copyright holder
  Redistribute the artwork outside an unmodified copy of this repository,
  modify it for redistribution, use it commercially, use it in another
  product or project, or use the persona as a name, logo or mark.

The MIT license of this repository grants no right to the artwork. To build a
firmware you can share freely, replace the artwork with your own.
